"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":277,"output":378,"cacheRead":35776,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":167,"totalTokens":36431,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784969010486,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-af44de4a-051b-44db-abf9-e32e92d7b95d","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.subagent:48","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Refactoring complete. All 6 tests still pass.\n\n## Refactoring Summary\n\n**Refactoring Applied**:\n- **Naming/Intent**: Extracted `survives(neighborCount, isAlive)` to make the Game of Life survival/birth rule explicit and self-documenting.\n- **Intent**: Extracted `compareCells` to name the cell-sorting comparator.\n\n**APP Mass Calculation**:\n\n| Component | Before | After |\n|-----------|--------|-------|\n| Constants | 15 | 15 |\n| Bindings | 25 | 26 |\n| Invocations | 13 (×2 = 26) | 14 (×2 = 28) |\n| Conditionals | 1 (×4 = 4) | 1 (×4 = 4) |\n| Loops | 4 (×5 = 20) | 4 (×5 = 20) |\n| Assignments | 2 (×6 = 12) | 2 (×6 = 12) |\n| **Total Mass** | **102** | **105** |\n\n**Mass Change**: 102 → 105 (+3)\n\n**Rule 2 Trade-off**: Mass increased slightly because a function call and parameter were added, but the Game of Life rule is now explicitly named rather than buried in a complex inline boolean expression. Clarity improved, satisfying Rule 2 (reveals intent), which trumps raw APP mass.\n\n**Tests**: All 6 passing, 5 todo."}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_08-40-38_game-of-life-example-mapping_v6.2.1-phase-continuation-pi_kimi-k2-7/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/game-of-life.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/game-of-life.ts\nPassing tests: 6\nRecent Green phase: Implemented full Game of Life algorithm with neighbor counting, survival, birth, and sorted output\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/game-of-life.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/game-of-life.ts\nPassing tests: 6\nRecent Green phase: Implemented full Game of Life algorithm with neighbor counting, survival, birth, and sorted output\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784969013378},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me start by reading the current implementation and test files to understand what needs refactoring.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.read:0","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/game-of-life.ts"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.read:1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/game-of-life.spec.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":73,"output":56,"cacheRead":6016,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":18,"totalTokens":6145,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784969013398,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-cc09c3a2-af9d-424f-9f9d-cff50ff8ebb8","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.read:0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"type Cell = [number, number];\n\nfunction cellKey(x: number, y: number): string {\n  return `${x},${y}`;\n}\n\nfunction parseKey(key: string): Cell {\n  const [x, y] = key.split(\",\").map(Number);\n  return [x, y];\n}\n\nfunction neighborsOf(x: number, y: number): Cell[] {\n  return [\n    [x - 1, y - 1], [x, y - 1], [x + 1, y - 1],\n    [x - 1, y],                 [x + 1, y],\n    [x - 1, y + 1], [x, y + 1], [x + 1, y + 1],\n  ];\n}\n\nexport function nextGeneration(liveCells: Cell[]):